2026-10-13T11:20:56.8362419Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8363469Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8363978Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8364506Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8364995Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8365446Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8365948Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8366415Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8367024Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8367456Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8367955Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8368452Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8369010Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8369501Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8369992Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8370497Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8370942Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8371407Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8372004Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8372567Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8373167Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8373648Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8374139Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8374486Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8374874Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
