2026-10-13T11:20:56.8375668Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8376078Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T11:20:56.8376549Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
